Two generic fixes to xray-core's HTTP outbound, required by tunnet-lite.
Apply on top of upstream commit f02a35786124a6ad046727f2408e32317cc19a41.

1. CONNECT could not honour a configured Host header, and redirecting it
   to req.Host alone rewrites the tunnel authority, so the real target is
   pinned in URL.Opaque first.
2. fillRequestHeader demanded inbound session metadata for any configured
   header, which made such an outbound impossible to health-check.

See the project README for the symptoms each one produces.

